Step 1: Create folder + go inside
mkdir gcp-api-demo
cd gcp-api-demo

 Step 2: Create app.py (same Flask API)
nano app.py


Paste this:

from flask import Flask, jsonify

app = Flask(__name__)

SERVICE_STATUS = {
    "cloudrun": "running",
    "github_pipeline": "failed"
}

@app.route("/status")
def status():
    return jsonify(SERVICE_STATUS)

@app.route("/status/<service_name>")
def status_service(service_name):
    return jsonify({
        "service": service_name,
        "status": SERVICE_STATUS.get(service_name, "unknown")
    })

if __name__ == "__main__":
    app.run(host="127.0.0.1", port=5000)


Save:

Ctrl+O, Enter

Ctrl+X

